From: verf1sh
Subject: [PATCH] Replace nyx_warn with nyx_debug for root snapshot message

The "Root snapshot is not available yet" message fires on every VM boot
during normal operation. Using nyx_warn floods the console with
unnecessary warnings. Downgrade to nyx_debug to reduce noise.

---
 qemu/nyx/synchronization.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/qemu/nyx/synchronization.c b/qemu/nyx/synchronization.c
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/qemu/nyx/synchronization.c
+++ b/qemu/nyx/synchronization.c
@@ -285,7 +285,7 @@
-        nyx_warn("Root snapshot is not available yet!\n");
+        nyx_debug("Root snapshot is not available yet!\n");
